  "details": "Description\n\nAbout a minute after joining friends+, friends, invite+ or invite insrance, all players around me freeze for 15 or so seconds. Then VRChat attempts and fails to reconnect two times, and then usually succeds on the third try. This has been happening for a bit over a month now. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJoin a non public or group world and wait a minute. Sometimes it happens, sometimes it doesn't. Im usually on EU servers.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1898-626e35030c-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-26_20-08-48.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_874c40ce-89c3-4654-8379-0766fb75a774/1/file)",
